Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're late, they'll disqualify\Nyou right out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.77,0:01:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to cheer you\Nfrom the balcony, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Only duelists are allowed\Non the arena floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.57,0:01:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guys, guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:01:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.39,0:02:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick some butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.39,0:02:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look who's finally awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I was starting to wonder\Nif you would even show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.07,0:02:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.98,0:02:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So you about ready to get your butt\Nkicked across the arena and back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I didn't have to\Ngo and steal the Star Chips
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to make it to the final round\Nof this year tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.97,0:02:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't have to\Ncheat to beat you, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.35,0:02:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a sad case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even realize I swiped your card,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the one you need to\Nqualify for the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already lost, and\Nyou're too dumb to know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The dual champion playoffs\Nare about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All finalists will now enter the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And now your host, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximillian Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, Joey, Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and Bandit Keith. I welcome all of\Nyou to the playoff arena. Here is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,where the last great duel monsters\Nduel Shall be waged to determine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the championship of the duelist\Nkingdom Only one of you shall emerge
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,victorious Only one of you shall\Nwin the three million dollar prize
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be me. That prize will pay for\Nmy sister's operation. And of course the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,victor in the playoffs shall also earn the\Nright to challenge me in the final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't that special?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.19,0:03:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does the playoff winner get\Nfor defeating you in the final duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:04:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The victor will be granted one request,\Nwhatever his or her heartmost desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it is within my vast power to\Ndo so, their wish will be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The victor will also be declared the\Nundisputed duelist kingdom champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,ranked number one in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The champion of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And boys, that'll be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely any duelist who has\Ncome this far must realize
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,that the title and not the\Nmoney is the real prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that not so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a regular comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The money's all I need for my\Nsister's operation. Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure some of you have more riding\Non this tournament than others, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.35,0:04:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, you've got my\Ngrandpa's soul and Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And even Seto Kaiba captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll find a way to\Ndefeat you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And save them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get\Nthis show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one of you will emerge\Nvictorious from these playoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wish you all good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shuffle your decks and\Nmay the best duelist win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The first duel will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My Valentine versus Yu-Gi-Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelists, please proceed to the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to keep the spirit from\Nmy Millennium puzzle under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't risk him hurting mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we begin, you must each show me\Nthe card required for your participation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Both qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel may proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you, Joey? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just getting the bird's\Neye view of the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.19,0:05:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe her out, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to be at my best if I'm going\Nto make it through these playoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.61,0:06:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I also have to keep the spirit\Nof my Millennium Puzzle in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if Pegasus can steal\Nsouls with his Millennium Item,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,who knows what the spirit of the\Npuzzle might do to win against mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to think the only person on\NEarth a duelist could trust was herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.33,0:06:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else was just an opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I met Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and I learned through him\Nthat even the strongest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,opponents in the arena could\Nstill be friends outside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If he hadn't loaned me his starships, I\Nmight never have made it to the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.35,0:06:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe him a very great debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.23,0:06:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Yugi an honorable duel, and\Nthat's just what I'm gonna give him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he thinks that means I'm not\Ngonna battle all out, he's dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give this match\Neverything I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So when Yugi goes down, it'll\Nbe a victory I can be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I like him, I plan\Nto duel hard, and I plan to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised him an honorable\Nduel, not an easy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, hotshot! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.97,0:07:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're playing honorably,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't try your psychic act\Non me the way you did on Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh, no tricks this time, Yu-Gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I believe her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's really come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.21,0:07:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not all smoke and mirrors, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without my tricks, I can\Nstill duel with the best of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I play...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Puffy Lady in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That move is Mai's standard opening ploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi knows what's coming, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.99,0:07:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's seen Mai's Hoppy Lady in\Naction like a billion times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.49,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll lay down a second\Ncard, which will finish my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.35,0:07:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I better finish this fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The quicker I defeat Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the less chance for interference by\Nthe spirit inside my Millennium puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia, the Fierce Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Harpy Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.45,0:08:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll set off my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No! My knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your gaia ran smack into my mirror wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,which cuts any of your\Nmonster's attack power in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as your monster attacked, the mirror\Nwall rose up to protect my harpy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fierce knight met an equal\Nattack from its own reflection,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,draining half its points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty darn slick, huh, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's my turn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,High fashion for harpy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The makeover's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady, attack Gaia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, like they say, nice\NGaia's finished last. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady's claw attack reduced\Nmy fierce knight to ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you fell for that trap, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're losing your\Nedge in a championship game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If I didn't know better,\NI'd say you're holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I am holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe this will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can just keep drawing powerful cards\Nlike him, this match will be over quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can stop worrying about the\Nspirit of the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.07,0:09:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I lay one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll attack with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see your harpy\Nlady stand up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Electrify that harpy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really off your game today, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You make the same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.47,0:09:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The mirror wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.59,0:09:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:09:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Summon Skull's attack\Npower is cut in half, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a permanent trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of turns too late,\Nbut now you're catching on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Better hurry and get that little\Nbrain of yours in gear, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the trap cards\NI've encountered before
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,disappear from the field\Nonce they've been sprung,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so your permanent trap\Ntook me by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the exception to that rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very exceptional, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it's on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.01,0:10:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll unleash the same\Ndelightful effect again
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and again every time you\Nlaunch an attack. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times\Nyou try to come at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters can never\Nreach my harpy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to have to bring your game up\Na few notches just to keep me interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's right, Yugi's game seems off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,His strategy is whack, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't just attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he thinking through his\Nmoves like he's always telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yugi, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, please, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't take that risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What is with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.47,0:11:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected a real battle from you, and\Nall I get is this lame frontal assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.85,0:11:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason I duel Yugi, aside\Nfrom the island trips, the clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the cars, the prize money, is the\Nthrill of trouncing a worthy opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'm not worthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not today, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body may be in this arena,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.19,0:11:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but your head and your heart\Nhave split for parts unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're questioning my fighting\Nspirit as well? Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you're\Nstill shell-shocked about
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the trouncing you got from\NKaiba in your last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.69,0:11:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your opponent now, and I want to\Nbeat someone battling at his best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.65,0:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not some duelist who acts like\Nhe's afraid of his own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to shape up, Yugi,\Nand get your act in gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'm going to knock you\Nout of this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Yugi, I can sense your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.85,0:12:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you're afraid to fully tap the incredible\Npowers of your Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,a fear I plan to cure you of\Nwhen I make your puzzle mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever's going on, it's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you win, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me win?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, hon, the way\Nyou've been playing today,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's a single\Nthing you can do to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised you an honorable duel, Yugi,\Nand I thought you'd give me the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready to do it for real now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to put your heart in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,or are you going to punk out i\Nwish she's sipping mai is even more
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.01,0:12:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,obnoxious when she's winning yuki\Ndon't let us psych you out man
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you just gotta ignore her but\Ndidn't my promise an honorable duel
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't think she's trying to\Npsych yuki out i think she's trying
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,to help him out like she did last\Ntime so you lost one match yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that doesn't mean that you can\Njust give up whatever is going on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,in your head just deal with it\Nand move on in her own weird way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,mai's just trying to help yuki\NShe's been dreaming of this rematch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but she wants to face him\Nat his best, not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.19,0:13:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, Mai, I'm giving all I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning won't mean as much if\Nhe's not at the top of his game,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but he just seems so distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, Mai, I'm not\Nabout to lose this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.89,0:13:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, make your next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, maybe he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am making too much of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I really do hope that's the case, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,On defeating you will be no fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi thinks I'll send Harpy\NLady to attack Summon Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he's played\Nthe other card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No attack this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I'm gonna sweep your trap away
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,with Harpy's Feather Duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The hidden card I played\Nwas the Spellbinding Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had declared an attack, your\Nharpy would have been snared in the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Very clever of you, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I do appreciate the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I might teach you a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.15,0:14:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai still has that mirror wall in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack without my\Nmonster's power being cut in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to alter my strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.91,0:14:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll switch Skull to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And to finish my move, I'll also\Nplay the Feral Imp in defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much else you can do, is there, Yugi,\Nsince I've left you no way to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.95,0:14:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Rose Whip to raise\Nmy monster's attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She keeps powering Harpy Lady and hiding\Nbehind that mirror wall as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:14:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We can defeat her together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your imp's gonna\Nfeel my Harpy's sting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whiplash attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nothing, Yugi. Stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The fun's just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Mai's really got Yugi rattled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's gonna try to multiply our\Nharpy lady next. Don't let her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to turn this around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's playing brilliantly\Nwhile my attention is divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.19,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd try harder, Yugi,\Nbut I see now that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, with this card, my harpy\Ncombo won't be quite complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.43,0:15:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'll give me more than enough\Npower to vaporize that grungy old skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce the\Never-faithful servant of Harpy Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy's oh-so-cuddly pet dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet as a kitten, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sweet as a\Nfire-breathing kitty can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And he gets 300 more attack points\Njust by sitting near his master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast that skull to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.43,0:16:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearsome Fire Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Harvey's Pet Dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I summoned Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, you've got to concentrate if\Nyou're going to stand a chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.03,0:16:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you playing so poorly, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you on the ropes, and\Nyou're barely putting up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to duel you at your best, but\Nthere's only so far I'm willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I remember Joey once asked me\Nan important question about why I duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer I gave him was\Nfrivolous, but honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:16:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you answer the question, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dueling for my grandfather, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's got a heck of a lot\Nbetter answer than you did, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, me and Yugi aren't just\Ndueling for ourselves, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But tell me, could it be your\Nmotives aren't entirely unselfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That maybe we should be more like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.51,0:17:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such a great duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I love me. How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You are such a twit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, can't you see I'm\Ntrying to be serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you trying to\Nseriously mess with Yuki's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're making him and me and\Neverybody crazy and dizzy and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you control yourself? You're wrong,\NJoey. I'm not trying to confuse Yugi and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.11,0:17:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you're off kilter enough without any help\Nfrom me something's happened to yugi and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll need more than his friendship with\Nall of you to snap him out of it there's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,only so much i can do i may admire yugi\Nbut I'm still determined to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to be distracted now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning this duel is all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This card would definitely be powerful\Nenough to defeat Harpy's pet dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.15,0:18:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while Mai's Mirror Wall\NTrap card is still in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.45,0:18:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I need another tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll match her trap for trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lay one card face down and then\Nthrow Dark Magician in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mai. Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.21,0:18:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've matched your mirror wall\Nwith a card called Mirror Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All your monsters will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will nearly\Ncomplete my harpy combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.69,0:19:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever trap you set for\Nme, Yugi, just became useless
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I play this accessory\Ncard, Shadow of Eyes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.13,0:19:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow of Eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.57,0:19:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the arena, I really don't\Nthink you're gonna like this at all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark magician is\Nswitching to attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the magic of Shadow of\NEyes It exudes an irresistible
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.27,0:19:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,force that can lure even the\Nmightiest monsters into battle
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai's trying to force Yugi into attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That means that throwing monsters\Nin defense mode is useless, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are you waiting\Nfor, Dark Magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Harpy Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know that you played a trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.39,0:19:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So Harpy's Feather Duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a dusting off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.29,0:20:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's eliminated my Mirror Force card.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.17,0:20:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to blow some extra\Nsmoke your way. Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearsome Tile Class!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.05,0:20:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have your favorite\Ncard, the Dark Magician, left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.79,0:20:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what is Yugi gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you can still turn\Nthis around. I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, it only looks hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.59,0:20:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you continue to hold\Nme back, everybody loses.
